{"id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"项解释","display":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["29-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-term]]"],"source_locator":"§1.1, p.7, DjVu scan 22","source_basis":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§1.1, p.7, DjVu scan 22"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-term-interpretation-—-项解释-$t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\beta$\">df-term-interpretation — 项解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\">\\(t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_q^{(d_q)}\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_q^{(d_q)}\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限词汇。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>；来源见所列定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式按有限项树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^k\">\\(\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^k\\)</span>；空元组允许。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta(x),&amp;t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\c_j^A,&amp;t=c_j,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq s,\\\\f_i^A(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{d_i}^A[\\beta]),&amp;t=f_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{d_i}),\\ 1\\leq i\\leq q.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta(x),&amp;t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\c_j^A,&amp;t=c_j,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq s,\\\\f_i^A(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{d_i}^A[\\beta]),&amp;t=f_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{d_i}),\\ 1\\leq i\\leq q.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^A[\\beta]),\\qquad\\langle\\rangle^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^A[\\beta]),\\qquad\\langle\\rangle^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页 7、扫描页 22 的项解释递归。各函数解释为全函数，且每个递归调用的项树严格更小，故结果存在唯一。将函数符号的数量改记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，避免旧稿让 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 同时表示项与函数符号个数。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-term-interpretation-—-项解释-$t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\beta$","text":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释 $t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(d_1)},\\ldots,f_q^{(d_q)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^k","display":false},{"tex":"t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\beta(x),&t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\c_j^A,&t=c_j,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq s,\\\\f_i^A(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{d_i}^A[\\beta]),&t=f_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{d_i}),\\ 1\\leq i\\leq q.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar t^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq(t_1^A[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^A[\\beta]),\\qquad\\langle\\rangle^A[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1964,"backlinks":[{"id":"533aac05e72771cc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37df1473b45d1ebc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta_{\\mathsf O}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf O}\\to|A|$、$\\beta_{\\mathsf N}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathsf N}\\to N_A$，$\\beta=(\\beta_{\\mathsf O},\\beta_{\\mathsf N})$；$s,t$ 的排序在相等原子中相同。数值项解释 $u^{A^\\#}[\\beta_{\\mathsf N}]$ 由下式给出，域项解释见 [[29-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"9f21a81def92d642","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anc